"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #33ff33; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190328142538&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Decay_908d54.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a wand of decay.<br/>Classification: 1 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers of level 19 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 23.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is half-rotten itself and reeks terribly.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>An upgrade from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Dragonbreath\">Wand of Dragonbreath</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">sorcerer</a>'s equivalent of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">druid</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\">Necrotic Rod</a>. However, many <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">sorcerers</a> prefer to wait until they can use the Wand of Draconia, since at a lower level <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">fire</a> is a more useful element than death. Provides 2 sqm of green light. Wands of Decay replaced <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wand of Plague\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Plague_347d90.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Wands of Plague in the Winter Update 2007. Needed for <a href=\"#/quest/mage-outfits-quest\">Mage Outfits Quest</a> (male) and <a href=\"#/quest/summoner-outfits-quest\">Summoner Outfits Quest</a> (female).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Life Gain on Hit\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+2 hit points on hit</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Life Gain on Kill\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+4 hit points on kill</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Magic Extra Damage Auto-Attack\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110320&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Gain_Extra_Damage_Auto_Attack_099693.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+15% of your Magic Level as extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Spell Damage Perk\">\n<div><img alt=\"16?cb=20250625080425&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skillwheel_Small_Perk_Icons_a3449f.png\"/></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img38\"><img alt=\"38?cb=20050524043100&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Force_Strike_86ee1d.gif\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+5% base damage for Force Strike</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As of the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026, the attack range has been increased from 3 to 4. The mana consumption was removed and the wand now generates 7-8 mana points per successful attack (displayed in the log as \"+1/+2\" and \"+6 mana\"). Note: Mana generation only triggers if the player's mana is below the maximum capacity.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Horror\">Candy Horror</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meandering%20Mushroom\">Meandering Mushroom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Menacing%20Carnivor\">Menacing Carnivor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Merlkin\">Merlkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Cult%20Priest\">Orc Cult Priest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Sh